of anything in my life.

12:08.047 --> 12:09.613
Well, except one thing.

12:09.649 --> 12:10.681
Good evening, sir.

12:10.717 --> 12:12.350
Would you like to
hear our specials?

12:12.385 --> 12:14.285
No! Pizza!

12:17.924 --> 12:19.357
Let me get
this straight.

12:19.392 --> 12:22.159
You want me to have
sex with another man?

12:22.195 --> 12:23.694
Oh, not just any man, Lois.

12:23.730 --> 12:25.196
This is Jesus
we're talking about.

12:25.231 --> 12:26.430
He's a savior.

12:26.466 --> 12:28.032
He could even save
our marriage.

12:28.067 --> 12:30.267
Why? What's wrong
with our marriage?

12:30.303 --> 12:31.869
"What's wrong
with our marriage?"

12:31.904 --> 12:34.138
You're sitting around, talking
about sleeping with other guys!

12:34.173 --> 12:35.873
Peter, this was
your idea!

12:35.908 --> 12:37.775
Lois, let's not play
the blame game.

12:37.810 --> 12:39.844
Clearly, there's been a lot
of cheating on both sides,

12:39.879 --> 12:42.146
but the point is
where do we go from here?

12:42.181 --> 12:43.481
Huh, I don't know.

12:43.516 --> 12:45.816
Sleeping with Jesus
just feels wrong.

12:45.852 --> 12:48.486
Doesn't the Bible say not to
covet thy neighbor's wife?

12:48.521 --> 12:49.720
Oh, come on, Lois,
the Bible's

12:49.756 --> 12:50.988
just a bunch
of general guidelines.

12:51.024 --> 12:52.923
None of the commandments
are written in stone.

12:52.959 --> 12:54.291
You're really
okay with this?

12:54.327 --> 12:55.327
Of course.

12:55.361 --> 12:57.395
Look, there really is
no downside to this.

12:57.430 --> 13:00.631
It's one of those things that
seems bad, but really is good.

13:00.666 --> 13:03.300
Like that fracking company
we let drill in the backyard.

13:04.704 --> 13:06.971
Well, I guess
it is kind of an honor

13:07.006 --> 13:08.973
that out of all the people
in the world,

13:09.008 --> 13:10.541
Jesus chose me.

13:10.576 --> 13:12.376
I mean, he could've had anyone.

13:12.412 --> 13:16.147
Elizabeth Perkins, Patricia
Richardson, Katey Sagal...

13:16.182 --> 13:18.616
Yeah! I-I mean, maybe not them,
but somebody else.

13:18.651 --> 13:21.552
And-and the Son of God's
first time should be special.

13:21.587 --> 13:23.788
Even divine.

13:23.823 --> 13:26.023
Maybe I'd actually be
doing a good thing.

13:26.059 --> 13:28.025
You sure about
this, Peter?

13:28.061 --> 13:29.061
You bet.

13:29.095 --> 13:32.129
As sure as I was
when I created Lady Gaga.

13:32.165 --> 13:34.031
All right, listen, fella,
your game is confusion.

13:34.067 --> 13:35.132
Zip! Zam! Zoop!

13:35.168 --> 13:37.234
Nobody gets a straight
look at nothing!

13:42.141 --> 13:43.841
Boy, this must be
killing you.

13:43.876 --> 13:44.876
You're an atheist,

13:44.877 --> 13:46.477
and the one guy
you don't believe in

13:46.512 --> 13:48.345
is getting to bang
the woman of your dreams.

13:48.381 --> 13:50.981
You know what? I don't have
to sit here and take this.

13:51.017 --> 13:52.750
I'm out of here.

13:53.886 --> 13:56.454
Can-can you let me outside?

13:56.489 --> 13:58.456
(doorbell rings)

13:58.491 --> 13:59.924
Hi, Peter.

13:59.959 --> 14:01.625
Well, hello, young man.

14:01.661 --> 14:03.160
Don't you look nice?

14:03.196 --> 14:04.662
She's almost ready.

14:06.566 --> 14:10.134
♪ There she goes ♪

14:10.169 --> 14:14.338
♪ There she goes again ♪

14:14.373 --> 14:18.175
♪ Pulsing through my veins ♪

14:18.211 --> 14:21.245
♪ And I just can't contain... ♪

14:21.280 --> 14:23.314
I'm sorry, I was just
coming down the stairs

14:23.349 --> 14:25.149
at the same time.

14:28.821 --> 14:31.622
Wow, Mom.
You look beautiful.

14:31.657 --> 14:33.224
Well, we know he's circumcised,

14:33.259 --> 14:35.126
so she won't have to deal
with that nonsense.

14:35.161 --> 14:37.061
Oh, and don't worry
about not hittinbottom.

14:37.096 --> 14:40.164
I've only grazed it once and
that was with a running start.

14:43.736 --> 14:45.769
Hey, Jerome, give me
another Pawtucket Pat.

14:45.805 --> 14:48.973
I'll take it over here
on my Brookstone massage chair.

14:49.008 --> 14:50.641
That's a nice
chair, Peter.

14:50.676 --> 14:52.910
Hey, do you think if I let
Jesus sleep with Bonnie,

14:52.945 --> 14:54.812
he'd give me back
the use of my legs?

14:54.847 --> 14:57.214
Joe, I don't speak for Jesus.
I just get him trim.

14:57.250 --> 15:00.518
Now to take this thing
out for a spin.

15:00.553 --> 15:02.153
(chair vibrating)

15:02.188 --> 15:04.188
(sighs)

15:09.395 --> 15:11.395
(birds squawking)

15:14.333 --> 15:17.601
Ah, time for a relaxing,
sponsored daydream.

15:23.576 --> 15:25.476
Oh, Jesus!

15:25.511 --> 15:28.412
Jesus! Jesus!

15:28.447 --> 15:29.914
(screams)

15:29.949 --> 15:31.749
God, I love
massage chairs.

15:31.784 --> 15:33.083
Are you in one, too?

15:33.119 --> 15:34.585
Yes, but it's horrible!

15:34.620 --> 15:37.588
It was bought for me by Jesus,
but now he's doing my wife!

15:37.623 --> 15:40.357
Oh. I'm just trying
mine out in the store.

15:41.827 --> 15:44.128
Guys! I think I might've
made a terrible mistake

15:44.163 --> 15:45.963
with this whole
Lois and Jesus thing!

15:45.998 --> 15:47.364
I don't blame you, Peter.

15:47.400 --> 15:49.733
I always thought it was
sort of a strange choice

15:49.769 --> 15:52.636
to let Jesus have
relations with your wife.

15:52.672 --> 15:55.739
I'm sorry, did you say Jesus
is sleeping with your wife?

15:55.775 --> 15:57.007
Great, now everybody knows

15:57.043 --> 15:59.210
my wife is taking
Jesus's virginity.

15:59.245 --> 16:01.512
Listen, pal,
Jesus ain't no virgin.

16:01.547 --> 16:03.781
He did the same thing
to me last Christmas.

16:03.816 --> 16:04.982
He what?!

16:05.017 --> 16:06.417
Yeah, Jesus did
the same thing

16:06.452 --> 16:08.185
to my wife
Christmas before last

16:08.221 --> 16:10.354
and my buddy's wife
the year before that.

16:10.389 --> 16:11.389
What the hell?

16:11.424 --> 16:12.756
But he's so lonely.

16:12.792 --> 16:15.326
Nah, he just acts lonely
and lies about being a virgin

16:15.361 --> 16:17.294
so he can get with guys' wives.

16:17.330 --> 16:19.096
Did he show you
that sad little apartment?

16:19.131 --> 16:20.431
He doesn't really live there.

16:20.466 --> 16:23.367
He just uses it to store art
he bought on cruises.

16:23.402 --> 16:25.536
Oh, my God, what have I done?!

16:25.571 --> 16:27.371
Peter, maybe there's still time!
Maybe you can stop them!

16:27.406 --> 16:28.672
Where are they?

16:28.708 --> 16:30.808
They're at the Barrington Hotel!
Let's go, guys!

16:30.843 --> 16:33.510
I just ordered nachos,
but good luck, Peter.

16:33.546 --> 16:37.481
Now for a slippy, no-boots run
through the snow to my car.

16:37.516 --> 16:39.516
(gasping)

16:51.430 --> 16:52.630
(screams) Aw, crap!

16:52.665 --> 16:54.531
I just pulled
a thousand muscles!

16:54.567 --> 16:56.567
(grunting)

17:03.576 --> 17:04.975
(screams)

17:05.011 --> 17:07.011
(grunting)

17:09.148 --> 17:10.714
Ow! That was a loud crack!

17:10.750 --> 17:12.249
Ah, yeah, that was all bone!

17:12.285 --> 17:14.351
Oh! Aw! Son of a whore!

17:14.387 --> 17:16.453
Oh, this is bad.
This is real bad.

17:16.489 --> 17:18.322
I'm not gonna go
to the doctor though.

17:19.892 --> 17:21.091
(ignition sputters)

17:21.127 --> 17:22.259
Damn it!

17:23.529 --> 17:25.362
(tires screech)

17:25.398 --> 17:26.964
Get out!
I need this car!

17:26.999 --> 17:28.198
What are you, a cop?

17:28.234 --> 17:31.035
No! Jesus is about to
have sex with my wife!

17:31.070 --> 17:33.037
Oh, then here! Take it!

17:33.072 --> 17:34.605
Get out!
I need this car!

17:34.640 --> 17:35.873
So do I!

17:35.908 --> 17:37.975
Jesus Christ is about
to have sex with my wife!

17:38.010 --> 17:40.477
Lenny Kravitz is about
to have sex with my daughter!

17:40.513 --> 17:41.979
Oh! Oh, my God!

17:42.014 --> 17:45.082
Here, take the car!
Take the car!

17:45.117 --> 17:46.317
Get out of here!
What are you doing?!

17:46.352 --> 17:48.185
Go, go, go!

17:49.221 --> 17:50.854
Hey, kid, I need
that toboggan!

17:50.890 --> 17:53.257
Jesus Christ is gonna
have sex with my wife!

17:53.292 --> 17:55.025
Um, okay.

17:55.061 --> 17:56.794
And I need
your little hat.

17:56.829 --> 17:59.063
And those Spider-Man mittens--
I'll need those, too.

17:59.098 --> 18:01.065
And what's in
your pockets?

18:01.100 --> 18:03.767
A rabbit's foot, a penknife,
a bottle cap, a compass...

18:03.803 --> 18:05.803
All of it, all of it.

18:12.378 --> 18:14.378
(tires screeching)

18:17.216 --> 18:19.350
Aw, crap. I'm out of hill.

18:21.921 --> 18:23.454
You there! Boy!

18:23.489 --> 18:24.955
What does that sign say?

18:24.990 --> 18:26.890
I ain't much
for book reading, sir.

18:26.926 --> 18:29.526
But I seen our Lord and Savior
bring a lady in there

18:29.562 --> 18:31.495
for a Christmas rodgering,
I did.

18:31.530 --> 18:32.563
You're a good boy.

18:32.598 --> 18:33.997
Here's a goose.

18:34.033 --> 18:35.599
(goose honks)

18:36.969 --> 18:38.535
What room is Jesus in?

18:38.571 --> 18:39.970
What room is
Lenny Kravitz in?

18:40.005 --> 18:42.439
Aw, you were coming here, too?
We could've carpooled.

18:42.475 --> 18:44.074
(elevator bell dings)

18:44.110 --> 18:46.210
Lois! Lois!

18:46.245 --> 18:47.945
You son of a bitch!

18:47.980 --> 18:50.013
What have you done
to my marriage?!

18:50.049 --> 18:51.181
Peter?

18:51.217 --> 18:52.316
Lois, don't do this!

18:52.351 --> 18:55.085
I think I had, like,
a Christmas miracle.

18:55.121 --> 18:57.254
I realized I don't
want other people

18:57.289 --> 18:59.223
humping my wife
for a chair.

18:59.258 --> 19:00.424
It's okay, Peter.

19:00.459 --> 19:01.525
Nothing happened.

19:01.560 --> 19:02.560
It didn't?

19:02.561 --> 19:04.528
No, I couldn't
sleep with him.

19:04.563 --> 19:06.330
Not that I wasn't tempted.

19:06.365 --> 19:09.266
He put actual strawberries
in a glass of champagne,

19:09.301 --> 19:12.369
which was about the classiest,
sexiest thing I'd ever seen.

19:12.405 --> 19:13.405
But...

19:13.439 --> 19:15.839
I couldn't go through with it.

19:15.875 --> 19:18.375
Our marriage is
too important to me.

19:20.980 --> 19:22.413
I love you, Lois.

19:22.448 --> 19:25.582
I don't know what
I was thinking.

19:25.618 --> 19:29.453
But you!
You're a liar, Jesus!

19:29.488 --> 19:31.555
Bravo, Peter, Lois.

19:31.590 --> 19:34.958
Seems like you folks learned
the lesson I intended.

19:34.994 --> 19:36.093
What lesson?

19:36.128 --> 19:38.128
Oh, you know, uh...

19:38.164 --> 19:41.064
that, uh, this holiest
of days is about,

19:41.100 --> 19:43.667
uh, appreciating...

19:43.702 --> 19:48.672
our loved ones and, uh,
resisting... temptation.

19:48.707 --> 19:50.874
Oh, so it was a test.

19:50.910 --> 19:53.777
Like when your father told
Abraham to sacrifice Isaac?

19:53.813 --> 19:54.945
Yes! That!

19:54.980 --> 19:56.847
That's exactly right!

19:56.882 --> 19:59.149
Uh, well, I can see
my work here is done.

19:59.185 --> 20:01.819
Well taught, Jesus.
Well taught.

20:01.854 --> 20:03.220
Yeah, I guess.
Who cares?

20:03.255 --> 20:06.190
I'm not even real.
Merry Christmas.

20:11.697 --> 20:13.297
Well, Lois, I'm sure glad

20:13.332 --> 20:14.998
you didn't have sex
with the Messiah.

20:15.034 --> 20:16.333
Me, too, Peter.

20:16.368 --> 20:18.602
Now let's open
your presents, kids.

20:18.637 --> 20:20.971
Oh, Rupert, you're
such a sneak.

20:21.006 --> 20:22.706
I wonder what it is.

20:24.710 --> 20:27.611
Oh. A Joni Mitchell CD.

20:27.646 --> 20:30.714
"To continue your
emotional education."

20:30.749 --> 20:31.982
That's great.
(chuckles)

20:32.017 --> 20:33.650
That's really great.

20:33.686 --> 20:36.920
Could you excuse me
for just one moment?

20:36.956 --> 20:39.623
♪ I've looked at clouds
from both sides now... ♪

20:39.658 --> 20:42.593
Who did he buy
the necklace for?

20:43.828 --> 20:47.301
I'm gonna let that teddy bear
go all the way.

20:48.270 --> 20:54.770
Thank you for watching "Family Guy" on
www.FOX-fan.ru